# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
.venv*/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Node / Next.js
node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# Local previews and scratch
.preview/
scratch/
*.log

# Local-only verification script. api/tests/ is the committed suite; smoke_test.py prints the
# headline figures without pytest and is referenced by the local docs only.
api/smoke_test.py

# Raw NISR source downloads stay local; the transcribed CSVs in data/raw are what get committed.
data/raw/*.pdf
data/raw/*.xlsx

# Microdata extracts stay local too. NISR/AFR release row-level data for analysis, not
# redistribution, so an EICV7 or FinScope .dta/.sav never belongs in the repo. The committed
# household layer is data/processed/households.csv, which is synthetic and calibrated.
# `**/` also covers an extracted archive folder, e.g. data/raw/EICV7_CS/*.dta.
data/raw/**/*.dta
data/raw/**/*.sav
data/raw/**/*.por
data/raw/**/*.zip
data/raw/**/*.7z

# AI agent instructions — local-only working docs.
AGENTS.md

# Local-only build tooling, working docs and video production assets.
#
# The exceptions below are files the submitted documentation names as deliverables or cites as
# authoritative, so they ship with the repository:
#   - METHODOLOGY.md and SUBMISSION.md are the documentation column of the submission table;
#   - MODEL_EVALUATION.md is where METHODOLOGY.md sends a reader for the model comparison;
#   - DATA_SOURCES.md and DATA_DICTIONARY.md document provenance and the household contract;
#   - build_data.py, build_snapshot.py and evaluate_model.py are the scripts those docs tell a
#     reader to run, so publishing the docs without them would create dead references.
# Everything else in docs/ and scripts/ (audits, roadmap, icon and screenshot tooling) stays local.
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/` is deliberate: an ignored directory cannot have its children
# re-included.
scripts/*
!scripts/build_data.py
!scripts/build_snapshot.py
!scripts/evaluate_model.py
docs/*
!docs/METHODOLOGY.md
!docs/SUBMISSION.md
!docs/MODEL_EVALUATION.md
!docs/DATA_DICTIONARY.md
!docs/DATA_SOURCES.md
!docs/TRACEABILITY.md

# Demo recordings are hosted on Google Drive, not in Git.
media/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
